Package: open.gismo
Title: Open-Source Analytics Platform Powered by workr
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
        "Jeremy",
        "Wildfire",
        email = "jeremy_wildfire@example.com",
        role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: A thin integration layer over {workr} that turns a project folder
    of workflow and configuration YAML into an end-to-end analytics platform.
    By default it runs local-first, entirely against a filesystem project
    folder: the 'og_*' functions scaffold, validate, run, and explore the
    {workr} pipeline while 'fs_lConfig()' backs it with local storage, so no
    external services are required. A GitHub backbone — the 'gh_*' functions,
    GitHub Actions for compute, and GitHub Pages for the front-end — remains
    available as an optional lane for shared storage, deployment, and
    publishing.
